cted program and {\"action\": \"submit\"}, or with {\"action\": \"request_demos\"}.","reply":"```python\nfrom collections import Counter\n\ndef transform(grid):\n    h, w = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n    row_groups = []\n    for r in range(h):\n        if set(grid[r]) == {3}:\n            continue\n        if not row_groups or r != row_groups[-1][-1] + 1:\n            row_groups.append([r])\n        else:\n            row_groups[-1].append(r)\n    col_groups = []\n    for c in range(w):\n        if all(grid[r][c] == 3 for r in range(h)):\n            continue\n        if not col_groups or c != col_groups[-1][-1] + 1:\n            col_groups.append([c])\n        else:\n            col_groups[-1].append(c)\n    tiles = [tuple(tuple(grid[r][c] for c in cs) for r in rs)\n             for rs in row_groups for cs in col_groups]\n    result = Counter(tiles).most_common(1)[0][0]\n    return [[1 if x == 0 else x for x in row] for row in result]\n```\n{\"action\": \"submit\"}","steps":[],"action":{"type":"submit"}},{"step":5,"kind":"observation","phase":"act","t0":1794077526.128,"t1":1794077529.098,"alias":"task-5f9a23bc","message":"Feedback since your last action:\nYour submission was INCORRECT. Wrong attempts so far: 2.\n\nSame instance. Task id: task-5f9a23bc\nTest input (29x29):\n8 2 8 0 8 3 8 2 8 0 8 3 8 2 8 0 8 3 8 2 8 0 8 3 8 2 8 0 8\n8 0 8 4 8 3 8 0 8 4 8 3 8 0 8 4 8 3 8 0 8 4 8 3 8 0 8 4 8\n2 8 8 0 8 3 2 8 8 0 8 3 2 8 8 0 8 3 2 8 8 0 8 3 2 8 8 0 8\n8 8 8 2 8 3 8 8 8 2 8 3 8 8 8 2 8 3 8 8 8 2 8 3 8 8 8 2 8\n6 6 0 8 8 3 6 6 0 8 8 3 6 6 0 8 8 3 6 6 0 8 8 3 6 6 0 8 8\n3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3\n8 2 8 0 8 3 8 2 8 0 8 3 8 2 8 0 8 3 8 2 8 0 8 3 8 2 8 0 8\n8 0 8 4 8 3 8 0 8 4 8 3 8 0 8 4 8 3 8 0 8 4 8 3 8 0 8 4 8\n2 8 8 0 8 3 2 8 8 0 8 3 2 8 8 0 8 3 2 8 8 0 8 3 2 8 8 0 8\n8 8 8 2 8 3 8 8 8 2 8 3 8 8 8 2 8 3 8 8 8 2 8 3 8 8 8 2 8\n6 6 0 8 8 3 6 6 0 8 8 3 6 6 0 8 8 3 6 6 0 8 8 3 6 6 0 8 8\n3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3\